  (text "FROM THE HAND-WRITTEN NETLIST THIS SHEET REPLACES (verbatim; the part notes are on each part's Note field):\n\nAUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. THE DRAWING IS ON ANOTHER PAGE - carrier.md §2, which draws the reference, the\nbuffer, the sensor and the ADC in one picture because they are one signal path. This circuit owns the\nreference and both halves of the OPA2197; carrier/breath-adc and interfaces/breath-sense-link own the rest and\nnetlist it against the same drawing.\n\nONE PACKAGE, TWO JOBS: half A buffers the 5.000 V into the sensor, half B the sensor's output before anything\nloads it. Single supply from +12 V, V- on the analog star.\n\nThe REF5050's other pins [ds datasheets/analog/REF5050.pdf Table 5-1]: TEMP, TRIM/NR and NC are left open -\nthe trim and the noise-reduction capacitor are not used; DNC must not be connected." (at 256.54 38.099999999999994 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0f044db4-4ac3-511b-98ad-fcf4fe25b8dd))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
